<p class="lead">Published in 1999, Keith's 27th book and the third in his trilogy of memoirs, following <a href="{{ '/no-brains-at-all' | url }}">No Brains At All</a> and <a href="{{ '/my-life-with-the-demon' | url }}">My Life with the Demon</a>.</p>
<hr>
